@CampusConnect_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

### Check the API and database
GET {{CampusConnect_HostAddress}}/api/status
Accept: application/json

### Register a student
POST {{CampusConnect_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Riya Sharma",
  "email": "riya@college.edu",
  "password": "Student123",
  "confirmPassword": "Student123"
}

### Log in (copy the "token" value from the response)
POST {{CampusConnect_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "riya@college.edu",
  "password": "Student123"
}

### Paste your token here
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Who am I?
GET {{CampusConnect_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Student-only endpoint
GET {{CampusConnect_HostAddress}}/api/test/student
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin-only endpoint (a student gets 403)
GET {{CampusConnect_HostAddress}}/api/test/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
